flowchart TD
  A[uvicorn starts main:app] --> B[lifespan context enters]
  B --> C[resolve DATABASE_URL — postgresql:// required]
  C -->|missing or not postgres| C_FAIL[ValueError — stop]
  C -->|ok| D1[run_postgres_migrations — Alembic]
  D1 --> E[db.connection.init_pool — asyncpg]
  E --> F[database.init_db — schema via Alembic]
  F --> G{BRIEFR_ENV=production?}
  G -->|yes| G1[production_posture_warnings — log each unsafe flag]
  G -->|no| H
  G1 --> H[webhooks.destinations.sync_env_destinations_to_db]
  H --> I[scheduler.start_scheduler]
  I --> I1[Register 14 base APScheduler jobs + up to 3 conditional]
  I1 --> I2[scheduler.start]
  I --> J[scheduler.maybe_run_on_startup]
  J --> J1{CVE count less than 10?}
  J1 -->|yes| J2[asyncio.create_task run_full_ingest_sync]
  J1 -->|no| J3[strip_auto_generated_summaries + enrich_kev_summaries]
  J --> K[maybe_run_mitre_on_startup]
  K --> K1{mitre or atlas count less than 10?}
  K1 -->|yes| K2[create_task run_weekly_mitre_refresh]
  J --> L[create_task run_epss_backfill]
  J --> M[create_task run_exploit_sources_sync if enabled]
  J2 --> N[FastAPI ready — /api endpoints live]
  J3 --> N
  K2 --> N
  K1 -->|no| N
  L --> N
  M --> N

  O[On shutdown] --> O1[scheduler.stop_scheduler]
  O1 --> O2[flush_api_usage_pending]
  O2 --> O3[close_pool]
  O3 --> O4[resilient_client.close_client]
  O4 --> O5[close_webhook_client]
